window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b191-74d3a746dcbffa8e.json"]={sha256:"74d3a746dcbffa8ea6be8d76015f4c49e68cabd515c05864be92623aaa29fe5f",value:{"id":"b191","title":"真空預壓軟土改良","titleEn":"Vacuum consolidation of soft soil","category":"underground","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課聚焦連結負孔壓傳遞、排水能力與卸載回彈判斷真空壓密。十個單元依序辨識作用機制、量化假設、驗證程序與故障徵兆，讓學徒追蹤從原始資料到工程判斷的每一環。每個算例都帶單位與限制，不把局部成功或單一比值當成完整系統合格。交接須保留基準、異常與權責工程師核准的條件。","summaryEn":"This course focuses on relate suction transfer, drainage capacity and unloading rebound to vacuum consolidation. Ten units connect mechanisms, numerical assumptions, verification procedures and failure symptoms so apprentices can trace each inference from evidence to judgment. Every example includes units and limitations; one successful observation or ratio does not establish system acceptance. Handover retains datums, anomalies and conditions approved by the responsible engineer.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"ug-ground","subcategoryTitle":"地盤改良與地下維護","subcategoryTitleEn":"Ground improvement and underground maintenance","learningTrack":"underground","learningSubdiscipline":"ug-ground","learningTags":["underground","ug-ground","ground"],"architectureFamily":"ground","architectureNodes":[["有效應力增量","Effective stress increment"],["漏氣與抽氣平衡","Air leakage balance"],["排水板水頭損失","Drain head loss"],["沉陷壓密比例","Settlement based consolidation ratio"],["卸載回彈預估","Unloading rebound estimate"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[3,1]],"diagram":{"type":"ground","labels":["有效應力增量","漏氣與抽氣平衡","排水板水頭損失","沉陷壓密比例","卸載回彈預估"],"labelsEn":["Effective stress increment","Air leakage balance","Drain head loss","Settlement based consolidation ratio","Unloading rebound estimate"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創教學算例，所有輸入均為假設，不是地標實測。教學假設，非現場設定值：教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。假設總應力固定，孔壓降幅由60增為66kPa，增加10%，有效應力增量也由60增為66kPa；這不能推論沉陷或強度同增10%，因壓縮性及應力路徑可能非線性。先列出符號、單位及固定條件，再以獨立計算器核算。敏感度只描述這個模型中的輸入改變；若邊界或物理機制改變，應重建模型而非線性外推。最後把計算值、量測不確定性及需進一步驗證的項目分列，由責任工程師決定能否支持下一階段。","textEn":"The following original example uses assumptions rather than landmark measurements. Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa. The relation does not imply equal suction at every depth. At fixed total stress, increasing assumed pore-pressure reduction from60 to66kPa by10% raises effective-stress gain from60 to66kPa. Settlement or strength does not necessarily rise10%, because compressibility and stress paths may be nonlinear. First tabulate symbols, units and fixed conditions, then check the arithmetic independently. Sensitivity describes an input change inside this model only. Changed boundaries or physical mechanisms require a new model rather than linear extrapolation. Finally distinguish the calculated result, measurement uncertainty and evidence still needed; the responsible engineer decides whether the conclusion supports a next stage.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":14,"enrichmentVersion":14,"stages":[{"id":"b191-v14-s1","title":"地層條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Ground conditions, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「有效應力增量」與「深度負壓傳遞」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Effective stress increment\" and \"Suction transfer with depth\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b191-v14-01","title":"有效應力增量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Effective stress increment: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「有效應力增量」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Effective stress increment” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"真空預壓透過降低孔隙水壓增加有效應力，不需要把相同荷載全由堆載重量提供。必須先說清楚所選土點的總應力是否保持不變，並區分抽氣系統壓力與土中孔壓。教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「有效應力增量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Vacuum preloading increases effective stress by reducing pore pressure rather than supplying all loading through fill weight. Specify whether total stress stays fixed at the selected soil point and distinguish pump pressure from soil pore pressure. At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa. The relation does not imply equal suction at every depth. Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Effective stress increment” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「有效應力增量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Effective stress increment”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-01-k1","title":"有效應力增量","titleEn":"Effective stress increment","text":"真空預壓透過降低孔隙水壓增加有效應力，不需要把相同荷載全由堆載重量提供。必須先說清楚所選土點的總應力是否保持不變，並區分抽氣系統壓力與土中孔壓。","textEn":"Vacuum preloading increases effective stress by reducing pore pressure rather than supplying all loading through fill weight. Specify whether total stress stays fixed at the selected soil point and distinguish pump pressure from soil pore pressure.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「有效應力增量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Effective stress increment\" is correct?","options":["只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","真空預壓透過降低孔隙水壓增加有效應力，不需要把相同荷載全由堆載重量提供。","只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Vacuum preloading increases effective stress by reducing pore pressure rather than supplying all loading through fill weight.","A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"真空預壓透過降低孔隙水壓增加有效應力，不需要把相同荷載全由堆載重量提供。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Vacuum preloading increases effective stress by reducing pore pressure rather than supplying all loading through fill weight. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b191-v14-02","title":"有效應力增量：定量估算","titleEn":"Effective stress increment: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「有效應力增量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Effective stress increment” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa. The relation does not imply equal suction at every depth. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa. The relation does not imply equal suction at every depth.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「有效應力增量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Effective stress increment\", which statement holds?","options":["只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b191-v14-03","title":"有效應力增量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Effective stress increment: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「有效應力增量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Effective stress increment” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。確認負孔壓感測能力與飽和狀態，讓有效應力推論有可追溯的原始資料。同時排除以下干擾原因：若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum. Check sensor saturation and negative-pressure capability so the effective-stress inference rests on traceable observations. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接有效應力增量時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。確認負孔壓感測能力與飽和狀態，讓有效應力推論有可追溯的原始資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over effective stress increment, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum. Check sensor saturation and negative-pressure capability so the effective-stress inference rests on traceable observations.","failure":"注意干擾：若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。確認負孔壓感測能力與飽和狀態，讓有效應力推論有可追溯的原始資料。同時排除以下干擾原因：若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。","textEn":"Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum. Check sensor saturation and negative-pressure capability so the effective-stress inference rests on traceable observations. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接有效應力增量時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。確認負孔壓感測能力與飽和狀態，讓有效應力推論有可追溯的原始資料。","textEn":"When handing over effective stress increment, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum. Check sensor saturation and negative-pressure capability so the effective-stress inference rests on traceable observations.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「有效應力增量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Effective stress increment\"?","options":["同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b191-v14-04","title":"有效應力增量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Effective stress increment: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「有效應力增量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Effective stress increment” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。","textEn":"Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「有效應力增量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Effective stress increment\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。","只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth.","A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b191-v14-05","title":"深度負壓傳遞：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Suction transfer with depth: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-04"],"objective":"說明「深度負壓傳遞」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Suction transfer with depth” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"排水板阻力、邊界漏氣與透水夾層會降低深部可獲得的真空效果。傳遞比值是一項診斷量，不是固定材料常數，也不能直接當平均壓密度。假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「深度負壓傳遞」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Drain resistance, air leaks and permeable lenses reduce deep vacuum effectiveness. A transfer ratio helps diagnose the system but is neither a material constant nor a direct measure of average consolidation. With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60. Compare simultaneous observations on the same reference basis. Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Suction transfer with depth” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「深度負壓傳遞」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Suction transfer with depth”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-05-k1","title":"深度負壓傳遞","titleEn":"Suction transfer with depth","text":"排水板阻力、邊界漏氣與透水夾層會降低深部可獲得的真空效果。傳遞比值是一項診斷量，不是固定材料常數，也不能直接當平均壓密度。","textEn":"Drain resistance, air leaks and permeable lenses reduce deep vacuum effectiveness. A transfer ratio helps diagnose the system but is neither a material constant nor a direct measure of average consolidation.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「深度負壓傳遞」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Suction transfer with depth\" is correct?","options":["只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","排水板阻力、邊界漏氣與透水夾層會降低深部可獲得的真空效果。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Drain resistance, air leaks and permeable lenses reduce deep vacuum effectiveness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"排水板阻力、邊界漏氣與透水夾層會降低深部可獲得的真空效果。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Drain resistance, air leaks and permeable lenses reduce deep vacuum effectiveness. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b191-v14-06","title":"深度負壓傳遞：定量估算","titleEn":"Suction transfer with depth: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「深度負壓傳遞」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Suction transfer with depth” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60. Compare simultaneous observations on the same reference basis. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60. Compare simultaneous observations on the same reference basis.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「深度負壓傳遞」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Suction transfer with depth\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非現場設定值：假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。","只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60.","A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b191-v14-07","title":"深度負壓傳遞：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Suction transfer with depth: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「深度負壓傳遞」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Suction transfer with depth” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。若深部幅值偏低，先查連通、滲漏與感測器，而不是直接增加上部堆載補償。同時排除以下干擾原因：在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones. Low deep suction calls for checking continuity, leakage and sensors before attempting compensation by adding surface surcharge. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接深度負壓傳遞時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。若深部幅值偏低，先查連通、滲漏與感測器，而不是直接增加上部堆載補償。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over suction transfer with depth, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones. Low deep suction calls for checking continuity, leakage and sensors before attempting compensation by adding surface surcharge.","failure":"注意干擾：在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。若深部幅值偏低，先查連通、滲漏與感測器，而不是直接增加上部堆載補償。同時排除以下干擾原因：在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。","textEn":"Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones. Low deep suction calls for checking continuity, leakage and sensors before attempting compensation by adding surface surcharge. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接深度負壓傳遞時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。若深部幅值偏低，先查連通、滲漏與感測器，而不是直接增加上部堆載補償。","textEn":"When handing over suction transfer with depth, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones. Low deep suction calls for checking continuity, leakage and sensors before attempting compensation by adding surface surcharge.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「深度負壓傳遞」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Suction transfer with depth\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。","只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones.","A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b191-v14-08","title":"深度負壓傳遞：失效診斷","titleEn":"Suction transfer with depth: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「深度負壓傳遞」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Suction transfer with depth” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。","textEn":"Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「深度負壓傳遞」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Suction transfer with depth\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b191-v14-s2","title":"機制、材料與定量設計","titleEn":"Mechanisms, materials and quantitative design","description":"本階段聚焦「漏氣與抽氣平衡」與「透水夾層補注」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Air leakage balance\" and \"Recharge through permeable lenses\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b191-v14-09","title":"漏氣與抽氣平衡：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Air leakage balance: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-08"],"objective":"說明「漏氣與抽氣平衡」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Air leakage balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"真空系統的可用抽氣能力必須大於進氣，且抽氣量受工作壓力影響。固定流量差只提供控制體的瞬時平衡，不能用額定自由空氣流量替代負壓工況能力。假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「漏氣與抽氣平衡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Available pumping must exceed incoming air and depends on operating pressure. A flow difference is an instantaneous control-volume balance; rated free-air delivery is not necessarily capacity at the working vacuum. At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s. Both flows require a common state. A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Air leakage balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「漏氣與抽氣平衡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Air leakage balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-09-k1","title":"漏氣與抽氣平衡","titleEn":"Air leakage balance","text":"真空系統的可用抽氣能力必須大於進氣，且抽氣量受工作壓力影響。固定流量差只提供控制體的瞬時平衡，不能用額定自由空氣流量替代負壓工況能力。","textEn":"Available pumping must exceed incoming air and depends on operating pressure. A flow difference is an instantaneous control-volume balance; rated free-air delivery is not necessarily capacity at the working vacuum.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「漏氣與抽氣平衡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Air leakage balance\" is correct?","options":["真空系統的可用抽氣能力必須大於進氣，且抽氣量受工作壓力影響。","只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Available pumping must exceed incoming air and depends on operating pressure.","A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"真空系統的可用抽氣能力必須大於進氣，且抽氣量受工作壓力影響。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Available pumping must exceed incoming air and depends on operating pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b191-v14-10","title":"漏氣與抽氣平衡：定量估算","titleEn":"Air leakage balance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「漏氣與抽氣平衡」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Air leakage balance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s. Both flows require a common state. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s. Both flows require a common state.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「漏氣與抽氣平衡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Air leakage balance\", which statement holds?","options":["只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。","只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s.","A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b191-v14-11","title":"漏氣與抽氣平衡：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Air leakage balance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「漏氣與抽氣平衡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Air leakage balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。比較維修前後壓力恢復，不以單次聽不到漏氣聲作驗收。同時排除以下干擾原因：漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure. Compare recovery before and after repair rather than accepting solely because no leak can be heard. Also rule out the following competing explanation: A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接漏氣與抽氣平衡時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。比較維修前後壓力恢復，不以單次聽不到漏氣聲作驗收。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over air leakage balance, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure. Compare recovery before and after repair rather than accepting solely because no leak can be heard.","failure":"注意干擾：漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。比較維修前後壓力恢復，不以單次聽不到漏氣聲作驗收。同時排除以下干擾原因：漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。","textEn":"Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure. Compare recovery before and after repair rather than accepting solely because no leak can be heard. Also rule out the following competing explanation: A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接漏氣與抽氣平衡時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。比較維修前後壓力恢復，不以單次聽不到漏氣聲作驗收。","textEn":"When handing over air leakage balance, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure. Compare recovery before and after repair rather than accepting solely because no leak can be heard.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「漏氣與抽氣平衡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Air leakage balance\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b191-v14-12","title":"漏氣與抽氣平衡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Air leakage balance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「漏氣與抽氣平衡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Air leakage balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。","textEn":"A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「漏氣與抽氣平衡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Air leakage balance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b191-v14-13","title":"透水夾層補注：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Recharge through permeable lenses: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-12"],"objective":"說明「透水夾層補注」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Recharge through permeable lenses” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"透水砂層可把區外水引進真空區，消耗排水能力並改變負壓分布。達西估算用於辨識補注量級，需先確認連通面積與水力梯度，不把平均土壤滲透係數當局部夾層值。取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「透水夾層補注」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A permeable lens can feed water from outside the treatment zone and consume capacity. Darcy flow estimates its scale only after connectivity, area and gradient are established; average soil permeability is not the lens permeability. With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path. Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Recharge through permeable lenses” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「透水夾層補注」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Recharge through permeable lenses”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-13-k1","title":"透水夾層補注","titleEn":"Recharge through permeable lenses","text":"透水砂層可把區外水引進真空區，消耗排水能力並改變負壓分布。達西估算用於辨識補注量級，需先確認連通面積與水力梯度，不把平均土壤滲透係數當局部夾層值。","textEn":"A permeable lens can feed water from outside the treatment zone and consume capacity. Darcy flow estimates its scale only after connectivity, area and gradient are established; average soil permeability is not the lens permeability.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「透水夾層補注」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Recharge through permeable lenses\" is correct?","options":["只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","透水砂層可把區外水引進真空區，消耗排水能力並改變負壓分布。","只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A permeable lens can feed water from outside the treatment zone and consume capacity.","A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"透水砂層可把區外水引進真空區，消耗排水能力並改變負壓分布。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A permeable lens can feed water from outside the treatment zone and consume capacity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b191-v14-14","title":"透水夾層補注：定量估算","titleEn":"Recharge through permeable lenses: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「透水夾層補注」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Recharge through permeable lenses” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「透水夾層補注」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Recharge through permeable lenses\", which statement holds?","options":["只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b191-v14-15","title":"透水夾層補注：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Recharge through permeable lenses: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「透水夾層補注」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Recharge through permeable lenses” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。隔斷或排水修改須由設計工程師評估周邊沉陷與水文影響後核定。同時排除以下干擾原因：若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge. The designer must review neighbouring settlement and groundwater effects before approving cutoff or drainage changes. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接透水夾層補注時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。隔斷或排水修改須由設計工程師評估周邊沉陷與水文影響後核定。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over recharge through permeable lenses, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge. The designer must review neighbouring settlement and groundwater effects before approving cutoff or drainage changes.","failure":"注意干擾：若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。隔斷或排水修改須由設計工程師評估周邊沉陷與水文影響後核定。同時排除以下干擾原因：若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。","textEn":"Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge. The designer must review neighbouring settlement and groundwater effects before approving cutoff or drainage changes. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接透水夾層補注時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。隔斷或排水修改須由設計工程師評估周邊沉陷與水文影響後核定。","textEn":"When handing over recharge through permeable lenses, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge. The designer must review neighbouring settlement and groundwater effects before approving cutoff or drainage changes.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「透水夾層補注」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Recharge through permeable lenses\"?","options":["對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b191-v14-16","title":"透水夾層補注：失效診斷","titleEn":"Recharge through permeable lenses: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「透水夾層補注」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Recharge through permeable lenses” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。","textEn":"Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「透水夾層補注」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Recharge through permeable lenses\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。","只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation.","A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b191-v14-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「排水板水頭損失」與「堆載真空疊加」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Drain head loss\" and \"Surcharge and vacuum combination\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b191-v14-17","title":"排水板水頭損失：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Drain head loss: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-16"],"objective":"說明「排水板水頭損失」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Drain head loss” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"排水板內部流阻會沿長度消耗負壓，折曲、側向壓力及細料污染都可能降低導水能力。簡化導水係數把流量和水頭差連結，其適用狀態必須與試驗環境一致。假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「排水板水頭損失」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Resistance inside a drain dissipates suction along its length. Folding, confinement and fines reduce flow capacity. A simplified conductance relates flow to head loss only under conditions consistent with the test used to establish it. For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m. Conductance is not soil hydraulic conductivity. A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Drain head loss” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「排水板水頭損失」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Drain head loss”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-17-k1","title":"排水板水頭損失","titleEn":"Drain head loss","text":"排水板內部流阻會沿長度消耗負壓，折曲、側向壓力及細料污染都可能降低導水能力。簡化導水係數把流量和水頭差連結，其適用狀態必須與試驗環境一致。","textEn":"Resistance inside a drain dissipates suction along its length. Folding, confinement and fines reduce flow capacity.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「排水板水頭損失」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Drain head loss\" is correct?","options":["只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","排水板內部流阻會沿長度消耗負壓，折曲、側向壓力及細料污染都可能降低導水能力。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Resistance inside a drain dissipates suction along its length."],"answer":2,"explanation":"排水板內部流阻會沿長度消耗負壓，折曲、側向壓力及細料污染都可能降低導水能力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Resistance inside a drain dissipates suction along its length. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b191-v14-18","title":"排水板水頭損失：定量估算","titleEn":"Drain head loss: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「排水板水頭損失」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Drain head loss” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m. Conductance is not soil hydraulic conductivity. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m. Conductance is not soil hydraulic conductivity.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「排水板水頭損失」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Drain head loss\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非現場設定值：假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。","只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m.","A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b191-v14-19","title":"排水板水頭損失：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Drain head loss: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「排水板水頭損失」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Drain head loss” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。把長度與接頭納入流阻模型，避免只採未受壓新品的目錄數值。同時排除以下干擾原因：排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures. Include length and connections instead of relying solely on catalogue values for an unconfined new drain. Also rule out the following competing explanation: A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接排水板水頭損失時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。把長度與接頭納入流阻模型，避免只採未受壓新品的目錄數值。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over drain head loss, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures. Include length and connections instead of relying solely on catalogue values for an unconfined new drain.","failure":"注意干擾：排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。把長度與接頭納入流阻模型，避免只採未受壓新品的目錄數值。同時排除以下干擾原因：排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。","textEn":"Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures. Include length and connections instead of relying solely on catalogue values for an unconfined new drain. Also rule out the following competing explanation: A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接排水板水頭損失時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。把長度與接頭納入流阻模型，避免只採未受壓新品的目錄數值。","textEn":"When handing over drain head loss, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures. Include length and connections instead of relying solely on catalogue values for an unconfined new drain.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「排水板水頭損失」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Drain head loss\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。","只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures.","A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b191-v14-20","title":"排水板水頭損失：失效診斷","titleEn":"Drain head loss: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「排水板水頭損失」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Drain head loss” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。","textEn":"A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「排水板水頭損失」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Drain head loss\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges."],"answer":2,"explanation":"排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b191-v14-21","title":"堆載真空疊加：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Surcharge and vacuum combination: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-20"],"objective":"說明「堆載真空疊加」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Surcharge and vacuum combination” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"堆載增加總應力，真空降低孔壓，兩者必須用同一測點與同一時刻相加。堆載也可能暫時產生正超額孔壓，因此不能把泵端負壓與填土荷載直接無條件相加。假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「堆載真空疊加」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Surcharge raises total stress while vacuum lowers pore pressure; combine them at one location and time. Filling can also generate positive excess pressure, so pump suction and fill loading cannot be added unconditionally. At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa. The pressure change already includes the combined effects at that time. Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Surcharge and vacuum combination” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「堆載真空疊加」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Surcharge and vacuum combination”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-21-k1","title":"堆載真空疊加","titleEn":"Surcharge and vacuum combination","text":"堆載增加總應力，真空降低孔壓，兩者必須用同一測點與同一時刻相加。堆載也可能暫時產生正超額孔壓，因此不能把泵端負壓與填土荷載直接無條件相加。","textEn":"Surcharge raises total stress while vacuum lowers pore pressure; combine them at one location and time. Filling can also generate positive excess pressure, so pump suction and fill loading cannot be added unconditionally.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「堆載真空疊加」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Surcharge and vacuum combination\" is correct?","options":["堆載增加總應力，真空降低孔壓，兩者必須用同一測點與同一時刻相加。","只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Surcharge raises total stress while vacuum lowers pore pressure; combine them at one location and time.","A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"堆載增加總應力，真空降低孔壓，兩者必須用同一測點與同一時刻相加。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Surcharge raises total stress while vacuum lowers pore pressure; combine them at one location and time. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b191-v14-22","title":"堆載真空疊加：定量估算","titleEn":"Surcharge and vacuum combination: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「堆載真空疊加」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Surcharge and vacuum combination” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa. The pressure change already includes the combined effects at that time. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa. The pressure change already includes the combined effects at that time.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「堆載真空疊加」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Surcharge and vacuum combination\", which statement holds?","options":["只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。","只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa.","A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b191-v14-23","title":"堆載真空疊加：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Surcharge and vacuum combination: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「堆載真空疊加」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Surcharge and vacuum combination” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。任何加載轉換由岩土工程師依監測及穩定分析批准，避免只看沉陷快慢。同時排除以下干擾原因：若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states. The geotechnical engineer approves transitions using monitoring and stability analysis, not settlement speed alone. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接堆載真空疊加時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。任何加載轉換由岩土工程師依監測及穩定分析批准，避免只看沉陷快慢。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over surcharge and vacuum combination, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states. The geotechnical engineer approves transitions using monitoring and stability analysis, not settlement speed alone.","failure":"注意干擾：若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。任何加載轉換由岩土工程師依監測及穩定分析批准，避免只看沉陷快慢。同時排除以下干擾原因：若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。","textEn":"Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states. The geotechnical engineer approves transitions using monitoring and stability analysis, not settlement speed alone. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接堆載真空疊加時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。任何加載轉換由岩土工程師依監測及穩定分析批准，避免只看沉陷快慢。","textEn":"When handing over surcharge and vacuum combination, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states. The geotechnical engineer approves transitions using monitoring and stability analysis, not settlement speed alone.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「堆載真空疊加」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Surcharge and vacuum combination\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states."],"answer":2,"explanation":"將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b191-v14-24","title":"堆載真空疊加：失效診斷","titleEn":"Surcharge and vacuum combination: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「堆載真空疊加」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Surcharge and vacuum combination” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。","textEn":"Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「堆載真空疊加」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Surcharge and vacuum combination\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b191-v14-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「沉陷壓密比例」與「真空中斷恢復」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Settlement based consolidation ratio\" and \"Pressure recovery after interruption\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b191-v14-25","title":"沉陷壓密比例：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Settlement based consolidation ratio: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-24"],"objective":"說明「沉陷壓密比例」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Settlement based consolidation ratio” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"用沉陷推估壓密度需要可靠的最終沉陷及相同荷載歷程。次壓密、地表填土壓縮與量測基準變化會污染此比例，應和孔壓消散一起判讀。假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「沉陷壓密比例」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Settlement-based consolidation requires a credible final settlement for the same loading history. Secondary compression, fill compression and datum changes can contaminate the ratio, so interpret it together with pore-pressure dissipation. For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80. Not every observed settlement component is suitable for this ratio. An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Settlement based consolidation ratio” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「沉陷壓密比例」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Settlement based consolidation ratio”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-25-k1","title":"沉陷壓密比例","titleEn":"Settlement based consolidation ratio","text":"用沉陷推估壓密度需要可靠的最終沉陷及相同荷載歷程。次壓密、地表填土壓縮與量測基準變化會污染此比例，應和孔壓消散一起判讀。","textEn":"Settlement-based consolidation requires a credible final settlement for the same loading history. Secondary compression, fill compression and datum changes can contaminate the ratio, so interpret it together with pore-pressure dissipation.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「沉陷壓密比例」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Settlement based consolidation ratio\" is correct?","options":["只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","用沉陷推估壓密度需要可靠的最終沉陷及相同荷載歷程。","只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Settlement-based consolidation requires a credible final settlement for the same loading history.","A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用沉陷推估壓密度需要可靠的最終沉陷及相同荷載歷程。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Settlement-based consolidation requires a credible final settlement for the same loading history. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b191-v14-26","title":"沉陷壓密比例：定量估算","titleEn":"Settlement based consolidation ratio: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「沉陷壓密比例」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Settlement based consolidation ratio” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80. Not every observed settlement component is suitable for this ratio. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80. Not every observed settlement component is suitable for this ratio.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「沉陷壓密比例」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Settlement based consolidation ratio\", which statement holds?","options":["只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b191-v14-27","title":"沉陷壓密比例：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Settlement based consolidation ratio: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「沉陷壓密比例」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Settlement based consolidation ratio” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。卸載條件須同時包含殘餘沉陷及使用需求，由責任工程師核定。同時排除以下干擾原因：若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops. The engineer sets unloading conditions using residual settlement and service requirements together. Also rule out the following competing explanation: An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接沉陷壓密比例時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。卸載條件須同時包含殘餘沉陷及使用需求，由責任工程師核定。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over settlement based consolidation ratio, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops. The engineer sets unloading conditions using residual settlement and service requirements together.","failure":"注意干擾：若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。卸載條件須同時包含殘餘沉陷及使用需求，由責任工程師核定。同時排除以下干擾原因：若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。","textEn":"Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops. The engineer sets unloading conditions using residual settlement and service requirements together. Also rule out the following competing explanation: An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接沉陷壓密比例時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。卸載條件須同時包含殘餘沉陷及使用需求，由責任工程師核定。","textEn":"When handing over settlement based consolidation ratio, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops. The engineer sets unloading conditions using residual settlement and service requirements together.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「沉陷壓密比例」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Settlement based consolidation ratio\"?","options":["使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b191-v14-28","title":"沉陷壓密比例：失效診斷","titleEn":"Settlement based consolidation ratio: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「沉陷壓密比例」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Settlement based consolidation ratio” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。","textEn":"An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「沉陷壓密比例」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Settlement based consolidation ratio\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。","只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely.","A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b191-v14-29","title":"真空中斷恢復：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pressure recovery after interruption: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-28"],"objective":"說明「真空中斷恢復」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pressure recovery after interruption” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"停機後孔壓回升速度反映漏氣、補注及土體排水的組合，不等於單一材料常數。短期線性斜率可診斷，但不得外推為全部深度的恢復時間。假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「真空中斷恢復」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pressure recovery after shutdown reflects leakage, recharge and drainage together, not one material property. A short-window linear slope can support diagnosis but does not establish recovery time at every depth. If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference. Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pressure recovery after interruption” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「真空中斷恢復」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pressure recovery after interruption”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-29-k1","title":"真空中斷恢復","titleEn":"Pressure recovery after interruption","text":"停機後孔壓回升速度反映漏氣、補注及土體排水的組合，不等於單一材料常數。短期線性斜率可診斷，但不得外推為全部深度的恢復時間。","textEn":"Pressure recovery after shutdown reflects leakage, recharge and drainage together, not one material property. A short-window linear slope can support diagnosis but does not establish recovery time at every depth.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「真空中斷恢復」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pressure recovery after interruption\" is correct?","options":["只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","停機後孔壓回升速度反映漏氣、補注及土體排水的組合，不等於單一材料常數。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Pressure recovery after shutdown reflects leakage, recharge and drainage together, not one material property."],"answer":2,"explanation":"停機後孔壓回升速度反映漏氣、補注及土體排水的組合，不等於單一材料常數。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pressure recovery after shutdown reflects leakage, recharge and drainage together, not one material property. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b191-v14-30","title":"真空中斷恢復：定量估算","titleEn":"Pressure recovery after interruption: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「真空中斷恢復」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pressure recovery after interruption” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「真空中斷恢復」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pressure recovery after interruption\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非現場設定值：假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。","只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not field settings: If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference.","A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b191-v14-31","title":"真空中斷恢復：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pressure recovery after interruption: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「真空中斷恢復」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure recovery after interruption” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。試驗必須有獨立監測及復原條件，不因教學斜率自行安排停機。同時排除以下干擾原因：感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions. Tests need independent monitoring and recovery criteria; the teaching slope does not authorize a shutdown. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接真空中斷恢復時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。試驗必須有獨立監測及復原條件，不因教學斜率自行安排停機。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over pressure recovery after interruption, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions. Tests need independent monitoring and recovery criteria; the teaching slope does not authorize a shutdown.","failure":"注意干擾：感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。試驗必須有獨立監測及復原條件，不因教學斜率自行安排停機。同時排除以下干擾原因：感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。","textEn":"Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions. Tests need independent monitoring and recovery criteria; the teaching slope does not authorize a shutdown. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接真空中斷恢復時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。試驗必須有獨立監測及復原條件，不因教學斜率自行安排停機。","textEn":"When handing over pressure recovery after interruption, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions. Tests need independent monitoring and recovery criteria; the teaching slope does not authorize a shutdown.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「真空中斷恢復」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pressure recovery after interruption\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。","只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions.","A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b191-v14-32","title":"真空中斷恢復：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pressure recovery after interruption: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「真空中斷恢復」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure recovery after interruption” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要真空中斷恢復符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for pressure recovery after interruption removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。","textEn":"Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「真空中斷恢復」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pressure recovery after interruption\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response."],"answer":2,"explanation":"感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b191-v14-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「周界水平收縮」與「卸載回彈預估」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Perimeter horizontal contraction\" and \"Unloading rebound estimate\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b191-v14-33","title":"周界水平收縮：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Perimeter horizontal contraction: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-32"],"objective":"說明「周界水平收縮」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Perimeter horizontal contraction” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"真空改善可伴隨向內水平位移，周界附近管線與道路需單獨評估。平均應變只反映兩點距離變化，局部裂縫及轉折可能比平均值更具破壞性。假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「周界水平收縮」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Vacuum treatment can induce inward lateral movement, requiring separate assessment of perimeter pipes and roads. Average strain describes separation between two points, while local cracks and transitions can be more damaging than the mean suggests. For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%. Record sign and direction separately. Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Perimeter horizontal contraction” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「周界水平收縮」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Perimeter horizontal contraction”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-33-k1","title":"周界水平收縮","titleEn":"Perimeter horizontal contraction","text":"真空改善可伴隨向內水平位移，周界附近管線與道路需單獨評估。平均應變只反映兩點距離變化，局部裂縫及轉折可能比平均值更具破壞性。","textEn":"Vacuum treatment can induce inward lateral movement, requiring separate assessment of perimeter pipes and roads. Average strain describes separation between two points, while local cracks and transitions can be more damaging than the mean suggests.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「周界水平收縮」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Perimeter horizontal contraction\" is correct?","options":["真空改善可伴隨向內水平位移，周界附近管線與道路需單獨評估。","只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Vacuum treatment can induce inward lateral movement, requiring separate assessment of perimeter pipes and roads.","A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"真空改善可伴隨向內水平位移，周界附近管線與道路需單獨評估。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Vacuum treatment can induce inward lateral movement, requiring separate assessment of perimeter pipes and roads. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b191-v14-34","title":"周界水平收縮：定量估算","titleEn":"Perimeter horizontal contraction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「周界水平收縮」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Perimeter horizontal contraction” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%. Record sign and direction separately. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%. Record sign and direction separately.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「周界水平收縮」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Perimeter horizontal contraction\", which statement holds?","options":["只要深度負壓傳遞符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。","只要透水夾層補注符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for suction transfer with depth removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%.","A nominal result for recharge through permeable lenses removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b191-v14-35","title":"周界水平收縮：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Perimeter horizontal contraction: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「周界水平收縮」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Perimeter horizontal contraction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。檢查基準點是否隨改良區一起移動，避免相對讀值掩蓋整體位移。同時排除以下干擾原因：以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits. Check that reference points do not move with the treatment zone and conceal overall displacement. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接周界水平收縮時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。檢查基準點是否隨改良區一起移動，避免相對讀值掩蓋整體位移。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over perimeter horizontal contraction, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits. Check that reference points do not move with the treatment zone and conceal overall displacement.","failure":"注意干擾：以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。檢查基準點是否隨改良區一起移動，避免相對讀值掩蓋整體位移。同時排除以下干擾原因：以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。","textEn":"Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits. Check that reference points do not move with the treatment zone and conceal overall displacement. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接周界水平收縮時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。檢查基準點是否隨改良區一起移動，避免相對讀值掩蓋整體位移。","textEn":"When handing over perimeter horizontal contraction, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits. Check that reference points do not move with the treatment zone and conceal overall displacement.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「周界水平收縮」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Perimeter horizontal contraction\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","只要堆載真空疊加符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A nominal result for surcharge and vacuum combination removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b191-v14-36","title":"周界水平收縮：失效診斷","titleEn":"Perimeter horizontal contraction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「周界水平收縮」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Perimeter horizontal contraction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要周界水平收縮符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for perimeter horizontal contraction removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。","textEn":"Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「周界水平收縮」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Perimeter horizontal contraction\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b191-v14-37","title":"卸載回彈預估：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Unloading rebound estimate: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-36"],"objective":"說明「卸載回彈預估」如何影響真空預壓軟土改良的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Unloading rebound estimate” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Vacuum consolidation of soft soil”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"移除真空或超載會降低有效應力並產生回彈，不能將所有累積沉陷都當作永久改善量。線彈性重壓模數只描述局部應力範圍，超出範圍或含次壓密需另算。假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「卸載回彈預估」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Removing vacuum or surcharge reduces effective stress and causes rebound, so accumulated settlement is not all permanent improvement. A linear reloading modulus represents a limited stress range; other paths or secondary compression need separate treatment. For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m. Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Unloading rebound estimate” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「卸載回彈預估」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Unloading rebound estimate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-37-k1","title":"卸載回彈預估","titleEn":"Unloading rebound estimate","text":"移除真空或超載會降低有效應力並產生回彈，不能將所有累積沉陷都當作永久改善量。線彈性重壓模數只描述局部應力範圍，超出範圍或含次壓密需另算。","textEn":"Removing vacuum or surcharge reduces effective stress and causes rebound, so accumulated settlement is not all permanent improvement. A linear reloading modulus represents a limited stress range; other paths or secondary compression need separate treatment.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「卸載回彈預估」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Unloading rebound estimate\" is correct?","options":["只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","移除真空或超載會降低有效應力並產生回彈，不能將所有累積沉陷都當作永久改善量。","只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Removing vacuum or surcharge reduces effective stress and causes rebound, so accumulated settlement is not all permanent improvement.","A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"移除真空或超載會降低有效應力並產生回彈，不能將所有累積沉陷都當作永久改善量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Removing vacuum or surcharge reduces effective stress and causes rebound, so accumulated settlement is not all permanent improvement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b191-v14-38","title":"卸載回彈預估：定量估算","titleEn":"Unloading rebound estimate: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「卸載回彈預估」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Unloading rebound estimate” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非現場設定值：假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「卸載回彈預估」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Unloading rebound estimate\", which statement holds?","options":["只要漏氣與抽氣平衡符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","只要排水板水頭損失符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。","教學假設，非現場設定值：假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal result for air leakage balance removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","A nominal result for drain head loss removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.","Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非現場設定值：假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not field settings: For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b191-v14-39","title":"卸載回彈預估：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Unloading rebound estimate: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「卸載回彈預估」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Unloading rebound estimate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。交接文件列出永久載重、剩餘沉陷及監測延續期間，卸載時點由設計者而非單次表面讀值決定。同時排除以下干擾原因：若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery. Handover states permanent loading, residual settlement and continued monitoring; the designer determines unloading, not one surface reading. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接卸載回彈預估時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。交接文件列出永久載重、剩餘沉陷及監測延續期間，卸載時點由設計者而非單次表面讀值決定。","observationEn":"Site practice: When handing over unloading rebound estimate, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery. Handover states permanent loading, residual settlement and continued monitoring; the designer determines unloading, not one surface reading.","failure":"注意干擾：若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。交接文件列出永久載重、剩餘沉陷及監測延續期間，卸載時點由設計者而非單次表面讀值決定。同時排除以下干擾原因：若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。","textEn":"Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery. Handover states permanent loading, residual settlement and continued monitoring; the designer determines unloading, not one surface reading. Also rule out the following competing explanation: Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接卸載回彈預估時保存原始紀錄、單位與基準。以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。交接文件列出永久載重、剩餘沉陷及監測延續期間，卸載時點由設計者而非單次表面讀值決定。","textEn":"When handing over unloading rebound estimate, retain original records, units and reference conditions. Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery. Handover states permanent loading, residual settlement and continued monitoring; the designer determines unloading, not one surface reading.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「卸載回彈預估」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Unloading rebound estimate\"?","options":["以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要沉陷壓密比例符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A nominal result for settlement based consolidation ratio removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b191-v14-40","title":"卸載回彈預估：失效診斷","titleEn":"Unloading rebound estimate: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"prerequisiteIds":["b191-v14-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「卸載回彈預估」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Unloading rebound estimate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要卸載回彈預估符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A nominal result for unloading rebound estimate removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b191-v14-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。","textEn":"Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]},{"id":"b191-v14-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「卸載回彈預估」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Unloading rebound estimate\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。","只要有效應力增量符合名義數值，就能略過邊界條件與獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error.","A nominal result for effective stress increment removes the need to check boundaries and independent evidence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v14s-brisbane-research","v14s-brisbane","v14s-changi","b-src-geotech","v14s-geo"],"curriculumVersion":14,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
